@startuml
!include style.puml


autonumber
actor "用户" as User
participant "atm : ATM" as ATM
participant "factory : TransactionFactory" as Factory
participant "tx : Withdrawal" as Tx
participant "pad : Keypad" as Pad
participant "db : BankDatabase" as DB
participant "cash : CashDispenser" as Cash
participant "log : TransactionLog" as Log
participant "prn : ReceiptPrinter" as Prn

User -> ATM : 选择“取款”
ATM -> Factory : create(取款, 账号)
Factory -> Tx : new Withdrawal(...)
Factory --> ATM : Transaction 父类引用
ATM -> Tx : execute()  ← 多态调用
activate Tx

Tx -> Tx : perform()（子类规则）
Tx -> Pad : readInt(金额档位)
Pad --> Tx : ￥500
Tx -> DB : getAvailableBalance()
DB --> Tx : 可用余额
Tx -> Tx : 限额策略.validate()
Tx -> Cash : isSufficientCashAvailable()
Cash --> Tx : 现金够吗
Tx -> DB : debit() ①先记账
Tx -> Cash : dispenseCash() ②后吐钞
Cash --> User : 吐出真实现金
Tx -> Log : append(流水)
Tx -> Prn : printReceipt(凭条)
Tx --> ATM : TransactionResult(成功)
deactivate Tx
ATM --> User : 显示“取款成功”，回主菜单

note over Tx, DB
  任一判断未通过（余额不足/超限/
  现金不足/金额非法）：
  perform() 立即返回失败结果，
  不记账、不吐钞，ATM 显示原因后
  回到主菜单等待重新选择。
end note

@enduml
